            <description sparkle:format="plain-text"><![CDATA[New: The battery card shows the time left quietly, and a day of charge as one curve, plugged-in time shaded.
Better: Buttons and drop-downs follow one rule in every app.
Fixed: A sudden burst of activity is no longer counted under Everything Else.
To try: Open the card and see your battery's curve fill in over a day.
Still to do: The Everything Else fix is not built yet.
Better: The GPU shows <1% instead of 0% when barely in use.
]]></description>
